  "description": "The new Mito embodies the core philosophy of ALAN’s new line of custom, handcrafted frames—entirely made in Italy. It is designed specifically for those who refuse to settle for standard, mass-produced products and instead demand exclusivity, prestige, and distinctive design. Blending classic lines with a contemporary soul, Mito is a timeless icon. It is engineered entirely around the rider, offering complete customization of geometries, finishes, and technical details.\n\nOne frame, infinite possibilities. The Mito frameset is an extraordinarily versatile platform, capable of adapting to any riding style and terrain—whether you are aiming for “Pure Road” performance or tackling “Allroad/Gravel” adventures.\n\nTechnical Flexibility: Mito seamlessly supports both 1x (1by) and 2x drivetrains, and features generous tire clearance for widths up to 40 mm. Mito imposes no limits. It is designed to be tailored perfectly to your unique needs, wherever the road—or the trail—takes you.\n\nMito is meticulously handmade in Italy using the sophisticated \"tube-to-tube\" (wrapped) construction technique. The frame features a meticulously selected blend of ultra-high modulus carbon fibers (T800, T1000, and M46J), expertly combined to deliver the ultimate riding harmony:\n\nRigidity & Responsiveness: Engineered for maximum power transfer and acceleration.\n\nControl & Strength: Tailored for precise, confidence-inspiring handling in all conditions.\n\nComfort & Compliance: Optimized to dampen road vibrations and reduce fatigue over long distances",
